      value: baby joe
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2775039833176612092, guid: 4f3e9e1e9f8f85041b0df700969cac10, type: 3}
      propertyPath: listDialog.Array.data[3].choices.Array.data[2].afterDialogs.Array.data[1].textName
      value: baby joe
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2775039833176612092, guid: 4f3e9e1e9f8f85041b0df700969cac10, type: 3}
      propertyPath: listDialog.Array.data[2].choices.Array.data[0].afterDialogs.Array.data[0].textCaption
      value: Correct! Following the herd leads to abundant food and safer conditions.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2775039833176612092, guid: 4f3e9e1e9f8f85041b0df700969cac10, type: 3}
      propertyPath: listDialog.Array.data[2].choices.Array.data[0].afterDialogs.Array.data[1].textCaption
      value: "There\u2019s so much to eat! I love my herd!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2775039833176612092, guid: 4f3e9e1e9f8f85041b0df700969cac10, type: 3}
      propertyPath: listDialog.Array.data[2].choices.Array.data[1].afterDialogs.Array.data[0].textCaption
      value: Uh-oh! The dry forest lacks enough vegetation to sustain you.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2775039833176612092, guid: 4f3e9e1e9f8f85041b0df700969cac10, type: 3}
      propertyPath: listDialog.Array.data[2].choices.Array.data[1].afterDialogs.Array.data[1].textCaption
      value: Thirsty...food...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2775039833176612092, guid: 4f3e9e1e9f8f85041b0df700969cac10, type: 3}
      propertyPath: listDialog.Array.data[2].choices.Array.data[1].afterDialogs.Array.data[2].textCaption
      value: Nothing......here...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2775039833176612092, guid: 4f3e9e1e9f8f85041b0df700969cac10, type: 3}
      propertyPath: listDialog.Array.data[2].choices.Array.data[2].afterDialogs.Array.data[0].textCaption
      value: Almost! You have some safety in numbers, but lack adult protection.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2775039833176612092, guid: 4f3e9e1e9f8f85041b0df700969cac10, type: 3}
      propertyPath: listDialog.Array.data[2].choices.Array.data[2].afterDialogs.Array.data[1].textCaption
      value: "Uhhh, I love you guys, but I don\u2019t feel so safe...!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2775039833176612092, guid: 4f3e9e1e9f8f85041b0df700969cac10, type: 3}
      propertyPath: listDialog.Array.data[2].choices.Array.data[2].afterDialogs.Array.data[2].textCaption
      value: Stay close!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2775039833176612092, guid: 4f3e9e1e9f8f85041b0df700969cac10, type: 3}
      propertyPath: listDialog.Array.data[3].choices.Array.data[0].afterDialogs.Array.data[0].textCaption
      value: Correct! Young <i>Parasaurolophus</i> often gather with others their
        age to learn and grow.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2775039833176612092, guid: 4f3e9e1e9f8f85041b0df700969cac10, type: 3}
      propertyPath: listDialog.Array.data[3].choices.Array.data[0].afterDialogs.Array.data[1].textCaption
      value: "Let\u2019s play!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2775039833176612092, guid: 4f3e9e1e9f8f85041b0df700969cac10, type: 3}
      propertyPath: listDialog.Array.data[3].choices.Array.data[0].afterDialogs.Array.data[2].textCaption
      value: Yipee! This is fun!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2775039833176612092, guid: 4f3e9e1e9f8f85041b0df700969cac10, type: 3}
      propertyPath: listDialog.Array.data[3].choices.Array.data[1].afterDialogs.Array.data[0].textCaption
      value: Uh-oh! The adult sees you as a disturbance and reacts aggressively.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2775039833176612092, guid: 4f3e9e1e9f8f85041b0df700969cac10, type: 3}
      propertyPath: listDialog.Array.data[3].choices.Array.data[1].afterDialogs.Array.data[1].textCaption
      value: "Whoa! Eek! I\u2019m sorry, I\u2019ll go somewhere else!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2775039833176612092, guid: 4f3e9e1e9f8f85041b0df700969cac10, type: 3}
      propertyPath: listDialog.Array.data[3].choices.Array.data[2].afterDialogs.Array.data[0].textCaption
      value: "Almost! They are peaceful, but not your species\u2014interaction remains
        distant."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2775039833176612092, guid: 4f3e9e1e9f8f85041b0df700969cac10, type: 3}
      propertyPath: listDialog.Array.data[3].choices.Array.data[2].afterDialogs.Array.data[1].textCaption
      value: "They don\u2019t seem interested..."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
